flowchart TB
  A["Operator launches a different<br/>llmctl-&lt;profile&gt; alias"] --> B["_cma_llmctl_ensure_active<br/>checks llmctl status first"]
  B --> C{Target profile already<br/>the sole running one?}
  C -- yes --> D["No-op — launch proceeds<br/>immediately"]
  C -- no --> E["llmctl switch &lt;profile&gt;"]
  E --> F{Switch exit code?}
  F -- success --> D
  F -- failure --> G["Re-probe llmctl status<br/>a SECOND time<br/>(never trust exit code alone)"]
  G --> H{Previous profile<br/>still running?}
  H -- yes --> I["Ordinary refusal:<br/>previous profile confirmed<br/>unchanged, launch aborted"]
  H -- no --> J["CRITICAL: llmctl rollback<br/>also failed — host has fewer<br/>services running than before"]
  I --> K["Underlying CLI<br/>never exec'd"]
  J --> K
  D --> L["claude / kimi launches<br/>against the now-active profile"]
